  "audit_plan": [
    "Reuse all eight existing cap<=1 definitions unchanged; no new parameter search.",
    "Audit all four ETF start periods and every saved holding/trade row for cash, shorts, exposure, financing and cashflow conservation.",
    "Keep SPY and gold on identical dates and assumptions, and retain all eligible failures.",
    "Disclose all known research rounds including adaptive choices; simulation count is not independent hypothesis count.",
    "Obtain independent adversarial reviews of causality, cash funding and overfitting claims."
  ],
  "anti_overfitting_requirements": [
    "Treat every already inspected period and instrument as development evidence, including later chronology called walk-forward.",
    "Before a new experiment, register the economic hypothesis, full candidate family, parameters, data universe, execution, costs, primary metric, rejection criteria and review date. Hash and commit that plan before examining outputs.",
    "Report every run and revision. Changing a rule after seeing results creates a new exploratory round; it cannot repair a failed validation.",
    "No automated search-until-a-winner stopping rule. If the declared family fails, record failure and require a separately motivated hypothesis for another round.",
    "Use chronological training and locked validation for learned models; fit scalers/features within training only and purge overlapping labels. Current rules have no trained AI model.",
    "Require sensitivity to nearby settings, higher costs, execution delay, distinct market regimes and a second source before advancing a candidate. Existing cash-only robustness coverage is incomplete.",
    "Account for the full search when estimating statistical confidence; do not compute DSR/PBO from only the eight displayed rows. Our complete historical trial count is unknown.",
    "An independent evaluation needs a genuinely quarantined sample or future data collected after a fixed plan. A short execution rehearsal cannot establish a return advantage.",
    "No new history-only promotion to live capital from this audit. Failure to beat both recent benchmarks already rejects these candidates for the stated return objective."
  ],
  "risk_note": "No borrowing does not imply low drawdown. The prior 25% research screen was not a user-approved loss tolerance.",
  "execution_limits": [
    "Idealized simultaneous fractional rebalancing at opening prices; actual orders must sell first and respect settled buying power.",
    "Historical adjusted OHLC and dividend reinvestment proxy; corporate-action availability and actual broker fills not audited.",
    "Daily-close drawdown, no tax/FX/minimum commission, no positive cash interest.",
    "Stateful dip-ladder extra-delay stress absent."
  ],
  "excluded": [
    "Original margined grid and all its controls",
    "All 16 cap>1 redesign/allocation rules",
    "Legacy annual selector, because its selection universe includes leverage"
  ],
